  "Migration formulas": [
    {
      "row": 2,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B2",
          "value": "Paste each of these into row 2 of its column, then drag down",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 3,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B3",
          "value": "They read her existing columns G (reason category) and H (Follow up). Nothing is keyed on row position, so nothing can land on the wrong order.",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 5,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B5",
          "value": "Cell",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "C5",
          "value": "Formula",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "D5",
          "value": "What it does",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 6,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B6",
          "value": "J2",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "C6",
          "value": null,
          "formula": "=IF($D2=\"\",\"\",\"\")"
        },
        {
          "cell": "D6",
          "value": "Return type - leave blank. You fill this when you paste new returns, from the Bosta Type column: RTO, CUSTOMER_RETURN_PICKUP or EXCHANGE_return.",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 7,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B7",
          "value": "K2",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "C7",
          "value": null,
          "formula": "=IF($D2=\"\",\"\",IF(TRIM($H2)=\"2/2\",\"No Answer\",IF(TRIM($G2)<>\"\",\"Reached\",\"\")))"
        },
        {
          "cell": "D7",
          "value": "Call status. If Follow up says 2/2 she called and got no answer. If she recorded a category, she reached them.",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 8,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B8",
          "value": "L2",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "C8",
          "value": null,
          "formula": "=IF($D2=\"\",\"\",IF(TRIM($H2)=\"2/2\",2,IF(TRIM($G2)<>\"\",1,\"\")))"
        },
        {
          "cell": "D8",
          "value": "Call attempts. Recovers the number she was already tracking inside 2/2.",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 9,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B9",
          "value": "M2",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "C9",
          "value": null,
          "formula": "=IF($D2=\"\",\"\",IFERROR(VLOOKUP(TRIM($G2),[1]lists!$I$2:$J$7,2,FALSE()),\"\"))"
        },
        {
          "cell": "D9",
          "value": "Root cause. Translates her old category into the governed taxonomy.",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 10,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B10",
          "value": "N2",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "C10",
          "value": "(leave empty)",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "D10",
          "value": "Size detail - leave blank. The old sheet never captured which way the fit was wrong, so there is nothing to migrate. She fills this going forward.",
          "formula": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": 11,
      "cells": [
        {
          "cell": "B11",
          "value": "O2",
          "formula": null
        },
        {
          "cell": "C11",
          "value": null,
